@startuml
title Nortadas - Use Case Diagram (Phase 1)

'Formatting

skinparam monochrome false
skinparam defaultFontName Futura
skinparam backgroundColor #adb5bd
skinparam ArrowFontColor #141414
skinparam ArrowColor #141414
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowFontName Futura
skinparam ArrowThickness 2
skinparam usecase {
    FontSize 16
    BackgroundColor #4c6ef5
    FontColor #ffffff
    BorderColor #4c6ef5
}
skinparam actor {
    FontSize 16
    BackgroundColor #4c6ef5
    FontColor #ffffff
    BorderColor #4c6ef5
}
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #4c6ef5
skinparam noteFontColor #ffffff
skinparam noteBorderColor #4c6ef5

'Actors

actor "Beachgoer" as User
actor "Weather Scheduler" as Scheduler
actor "Open-Meteo API" as OpenMeteo <<external>>

'Use cases

rectangle "Nortada - Phase 1 (backend + mobile)" {
    usecase "View beach list\nwith Nortada status" as UC_ViewList
    usecase "View beach detail\nwith Nortada status" as UC_ViewDetail
    usecase "Fetch weather data\nfor all beaches" as UC_FetchWeather
    usecase "Determine Nortada\nstatus for a beach" as UC_DetectNortada

    UC_ViewList .> UC_DetectNortada : <<include>>
    UC_ViewDetail .> UC_DetectNortada : <<include>>
    UC_FetchWeather .> UC_DetectNortada : <<include>>
}

User --> UC_ViewList
User --> UC_ViewDetail

Scheduler --> UC_FetchWeather
UC_FetchWeather --> OpenMeteo : > requests wind data from

note right of UC_DetectNortada
  Encapsulates the rule: wind direction
  315°-45° and speed > 15 km/h.
  Runs year-round (see US010).
end note

note bottom of Scheduler
  Runs hourly (see US009).
  Comment/Vote/Favourite use cases
  are out of scope for Phase 1 - the
  domain model anticipates them but no
  Phase 1 user story requires them yet.
end note

@enduml
